| Action Recognition 2D | 220 | 372 | 440 | 483 | 1158 | 1517 |
| Action Recognition 3D | 13 | 26 | 32 | 39 | 71 | 108 |
| LPR Net | 552 | 974 | 1314 | 1427 | 2800 | 4213 |
